+The native transform oscillator's lifetime component already toggles its bool on startup. Initializing that bool true toggled the target back to identity and could stall the Done/Toggle loop. Both initial conditions now start false; the lifetime toggle starts the enlarged target. Selection scale is 1.0–1.06 over 1.8 seconds. The asset author checks the serialized initial polarity, both lifetime connections, and the Done/Toggle feedback connection. The tight ring, outlined caption, artwork colors, native input graph, typed tile bindings and isolated checkpoint shader subset are preserved.
