+Evidence for this update uses `placement-controls-` and `placement-pulse-` log prefixes. The mode-rules checks cover rejected acquisition, acknowledgement, camera loss, cancellation with an enable still queued, repeated reopen/exit, delayed restoration and borrowing. The native flag bridge passes 144 checks, including Back during the grace interval through both setup APIs, repeated race/1-Up switching, omitted OnEnd recovery and protection of an actual flag/MMID. Runtime and asset checks establish implementation consistency; the camera, animated selection and complete route still require the user's live gameplay retest.
