+Correction established by the next live log: the phrase "native name hash" above was inaccurate. Model fields require the **reflection NameHash** (`0x042ddc73` for NameTag), while the graph/navigation hash of the same text is `0xbbfa6270` and cannot address that model field. The subsequent repair uses the verified reflection constant at all four profile paths.
